Having abandoned this body, he goes alone to the darkest parts of hell, and with other
living beings, the wealth he had earned by doing business goes with him as a treasure.
He goes. Meaning: When a person earns wealth through improper means and uses that wealth to support his family and
himself, that wealth, although enjoyed by many members of the family,
he has to go to hell alone. The person who earns wealth or competes with others,
enjoys life, and the one who enjoys life with his family and friends,
will have to bear the consequences of such violent and illegal life's sins alone.
For example,
If a person obtains some wealth by killing someone, and with that wealth, he nourishes his family,
then those who consume this earned black money are also partly
